icipated Allied invasion. The Type 3 Chi-Nu had a crew of 5 and a secondary armament of a single 7.7 mm Type 97 machine gun.","LocalizedString":"Type 3 Chi-Nu  was a Japanese medium tank used by the Imperial Japanese Army in WWII. The tank was an improved version of the Type 97 Chi-Ha and used a Type 3 75 mm tank gun which was one the largest tank guns used by the Japanese forces in the war. 144 to 166 units were produced from 1944 to 1945 and due to its late arrival it did not see combat during the war as all units were used for defense of the homeland for the anticipated Allied invasion. The Type 3 Chi-Nu had a crew of 5 and a secondary armament of a single 7.7 mm Type 97 machine gun."},"operationCost":2,"rarity":"ERarityEnum::Uncommon","cardSet":"ECardSetEnum::Basic","isInPermanentPool":true,"extraHelpTextBubbleTypes":["EHelpBubbleTypes::Guard","EHelpBubbleTypes::Ambush"],"soundEnterPlay":{"ObjectName":"SoundWave'Tank_Light_Move_Fx'","ObjectPath":"kards/Content/Assets/Audio/Units/Tank_Light_Move_Fx.0"},"soundMoveToFrontline":{"ObjectName":"SoundWave'Tank_Light_Move_Fx'","ObjectPath":"kards/Content/Assets/Audio/Units/Tank_Light_Move_Fx.0"},"soundBlowUp":{"ObjectName":"SoundWave'Explosion01'","ObjectPath":"kards/Content/StarterContent/Audio/Explosion01.0"},"Image":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Assets/Textures/Images/Japan/t_type3_chi_nu.t_type3_chi_nu","SubPathString":""},"artist":"Yoshiyuki Takani","historyPhoto":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Assets/Textures/HistoricalPhotos/TYPE_3_CHI-NU.TYPE_3_CHI-NU","SubPathString":""},"historyPhotoSize":{"X":512.0,"Y":349.0},"historyPhotoSource":"Andrzej M. Tomczyk. Japońska broń pancerna Vol. 4. — AJ Press, 2005 (TankPower № 12)","historyPhotoIdentificationCode":"ISBN 8-37237-167-9","historyPhotoDescription":{"Namespace":"card_japan","Key":"card_unit_type_3_chi_nu_photo","SourceString":"Type 3 Chi-Nu tank during maintenance, 1945.","LocalizedString":"Type 3 Chi-Nu tank during maintenance, 1945."},"historyTypeDescription":{"Namespace":"c